).
To validate that these uORFs function as translational repressors, we performed a dual-luciferase assay comparing wild-type uORFs with mutated uORFs, where the start codon ATG was mutated to AGG, in
S6K1
and
RGA1
(
Fig. 8, D and E
). Upon mutating the uORFs, the downstream firefly luciferase (FLUC) reporter showed increased protein levels/activity (
