from cool white fluorescent bulbs) and 8-h dark cycle at 22 °C. Finely cut leaf slices were immersed in enzyme solution (1% [w/v] cellulase, 0.25% [w/v] macerozyme, 0.4 M mannitol, 20 mM KCl, 20 mM MES, and 10 mM CaCl
2
) followed by vacuum infiltration for 30 min and gentle shaking at 40 rpm in the dark for 2 to 2.5 h at room temperature to release the protoplasts. The protoplasts were passed through a 70-
µ
m cell strainer, centrifuged at 100
× g
at 4 °C for 3 min, and washed with cold W5 solution (154 mM NaCl, 125 mM CaCl
2
, 5 mM KCl, and 2 mM MES) twice. The protoplasts were counted and resuspended in MMG solution (4.5 mM MES [pH 5.7], 0.4 M mannitol, and 15 mM MgCl
2
) at 1 × 10
5
protoplasts/150
µ
