× g
for 3 min, and 20
µ
L of the supernatant was used for the dual-luciferase assay measured in a GloMax Navigator Plate Reader (Promega, GM2010) as specified by the manufacturer. FLUC luminescence was normalized to their corresponding REN luminescence.
